 ['kitchen-splashback-tiling-adelaide.html','Before setting out, we check the existing wall finish, accessible lining, flatness and signs of moisture or damage. Removing old tiles can leave adhesive or damaged plaster that needs preparation. Tiling over an existing finish is conditional on its condition and compatibility; a neat surface alone does not show that it is a suitable base.','We remove old adhesive, repair damaged wall lining and prepare a flat, sound surface for your new splashback. We check any damp areas before tiling, so the new finish starts with the right base.','我们清理旧胶层、修补受损墙衬，为新的防溅墙准备平整、稳固的表面。铺砖前检查受潮位置，让新饰面从合适的基层开始。'],
 ['kitchen-splashback-tiling-adelaide.html','Benchtops and fixed cabinetry need to be in their agreed positions. Confirm what stays, what is being replaced and who makes the wall ready after other work. This service covers the tiled splashback rather than a full kitchen renovation. For kitchen floors, see','We plan the splashback around your finished benchtop and cabinets, whether you are keeping the existing kitchen or fitting new joinery. For a matching floor update, explore','无论保留原厨房还是安装新橱柜，我们都围绕完成后的台面与橱柜规划防溅墙。需要同步更新地面，可查看'],
 ['kitchen-splashback-tiling-adelaide.html','As your kitchen splashback tiler in Adelaide, we plan the starting line, grout joints and cut positions around windows, cabinetry, corners and outlets. Tile dimensions and patterns affect where narrow cuts fall, how corners meet and how much material is needed. Discuss the visible set-out before ordering and installation.','We set out your splashback around windows, cabinets, corners and outlets, balancing the pattern and visible cuts. Before you order, we help plan tile quantities, joint spacing and edge trims around the look you want.','我们围绕窗户、橱柜、转角与插座排砖，协调图案和可见切割。订砖前，团队帮您围绕理想效果规划数量、砖缝与收口条。'],
 ['kitchen-splashback-tiling-adelaide.html','Electrical outlets must be made safe and handled by an appropriate licensed electrician. Gas and plumbing changes need the relevant licensed trade. Tile cuts around a fitting do not include disconnecting, moving or reconnecting it; agree that coordination separately.','We plan the tiling around any outlet or appliance changes. Electrical, gas and plumbing connections are handled by the appropriate licensed trades, with the sequence confirmed before installation.','我们配合插座或设备改动安排贴砖。电气、燃气与管道连接由相应持牌工种处理，安装前落实好工序衔接。'],
 ['kitchen-splashback-tiling-adelaide.html','The wall-to-benchtop junction needs a suitable flexible joint detail where movement is expected. Rigid grout is not interchangeable with flexible sealant at that connection. The joint must be clean, prepared and compatible with the adjoining materials; applying a new bead over a failed or contaminated joint can leave the cause unresolved.','We clean and prepare the wall-to-benchtop junction, then apply a compatible flexible seal where movement is expected. The finishing detail connects the tiles and benchtop neatly while allowing for movement at the joint.','我们清理并处理墙面与台面的交界，在需要适应位移的位置使用匹配的柔性密封胶。让瓷砖与台面收口整洁，同时保留接缝需要的活动余量。'],
 ['kitchen-splashback-tiling-adelaide.html','If a new benchtop leaves a gap beneath the old splashback, assess its size, exposed wall and surrounding tile condition before choosing a finish. A gap may need lining repair, a tile adjustment or a planned replacement area rather than simply a thicker sealant bead. We agree the visible result and limits before work begins.','Replacing a benchtop can leave a gap beneath existing tiles. We inspect the opening and recommend a neat finish using lining repair, tile adjustment or replacement tiles as needed. You can discuss the visible result with us before work starts.','更换台面后，原有瓷砖下方可能出现空隙。我们检查开口，根据需要修补墙衬、调整或更换瓷砖，做好整洁收口。开工前即可与我们沟通最终外观。'],
 ['kitchen-splashback-tiling-adelaide.html','Behind a sink, consider splashing, cleaning and the condition of the wall and benchtop connection. Behind a cooktop, the appliance instructions, heat exposure, wall construction and proposed tile, adhesive and joint materials must be checked together. Material suitability depends on the actual installation; there is no single clearance that suits every cooktop or wall system.','We help choose tiles and joint materials for splashes, cleaning and heat around your sink and cooktop. For the cooking area, we check the appliance installation requirements alongside the wall construction and tile system before setting the splashback height.','我们围绕水槽与灶台的溅水、清洁和受热情况选择瓷砖与接缝材料。烹饪区先结合设备安装要求、墙体与铺砖系统，确定防溅墙高度。'],
 ['kitchen-splashback-tiling-adelaide.html','Tell us the appliance model and whether it or the cabinetry is changing. Resolve required clearances and separate trade work before finalising the tiled area. Where moisture damage suggests a wider issue,','Tell us about your new appliances or cabinetry so we can plan the work together. If the wall or floor also needs moisture protection, explore our','告诉我们设备或橱柜的更新计划，方便统筹施工。墙面或地面也需要防潮处理时，可了解我们的'],
 ['kitchen-splashback-tiling-adelaide.html','is a separate consideration.','for the connected work.','，衔接相关施工。'],
 ['kitchen-splashback-tiling-adelaide.html','Removal, lining repairs, layout complexity, trims and access around retained fittings affect the quote. An occupied kitchen may need temporary restrictions while materials set or cure. Agree access to the sink and cooking area, appliance work and the return-to-use instructions for the selected materials.','Your quote sets out removal, wall preparation, tile layout, trims and installation. We plan access to the sink and cooking area with you, then explain when the new grout and seals are ready for everyday use.','报价列明拆除、墙面准备、排砖、收口条与安装。我们和您安排水槽、烹饪区的使用，并在完成后说明新填缝与密封何时可恢复日常使用。'],
 ['floor-tiling-adelaide.html','Larger tiles span more of the base, so unevenness can make consistent support and adjoining tile edges harder to achieve. Levelling clips do not make an unsuitable substrate sound or replace necessary preparation. We assess the base and selected format before confirming levelling work and installation limits.','Large-format tiles need a carefully prepared base. We check flatness, arrange the necessary levelling and plan support beneath the tiles to achieve consistent adjoining edges and a balanced layout.','大规格瓷砖需要细致处理基层。我们检查平整度、安排必要找平并规划砖下支撑，让相邻砖边与整体排布协调。'],
 ['floor-tiling-adelaide.html','Choose tiles by specification as well as appearance. Size, thickness, condition, intended floor use, surface texture and cleaning needs affect suitability. Adhesive must be compatible with the tile, base and any membrane; one adhesive cannot be assumed suitable for every combination. Tile texture alone cannot guarantee a slip-proof floor. Confirm the proposed tile and format before purchase.','We help you consider tile size, thickness, floor-use specifications and cleaning alongside appearance. Our installation materials are selected to work with your tiles, base and any membrane. Share your preferred tiles before purchase so we can plan the finish together.','选砖时，我们帮您一起考虑外观、规格、厚度、地面使用要求与清洁。安装材料与瓷砖、基层及防水层相匹配。购买前即可把喜欢的砖发给我们，一起规划完成效果。'],
 ['pool-surround-tiling-adelaide.html','This service covers pool surrounds, not tiling or waterproofing inside the pool. Pool-interior or water-retaining work needs a separate suitability assessment and confirmed scope. A pool surround photograph is not evidence of a pool-interior membrane installation.','We tile poolside terraces, walking areas and coping edges. For the water-retaining surface inside the pool, our pool waterproofing service covers the interior preparation and membrane work.','我们承接泳池露台、步行区域及池沿贴砖。池内蓄水表面的基层与防水层施工，可查看泳池防水服务。'],
 ['bathroom-tiling-adelaide.html','for a verified Ellis team project, rather than assuming every bathroom needs the same scope.','with photographs of our work at different stages.','，了解我们各施工阶段的实况。'],
 ['shower-regrouting-resealing-adelaide.html','Grout fills joints between tiles; silicone provides a flexible seal at suitable corners and changes of plane where movement needs to be accommodated. They are not interchangeable, and neither renews the concealed waterproofing membrane. We identify the joint type and check adjoining tiles before repair: filling a flexible junction with rigid grout does not provide the same movement allowance.','We renew grout between tiles and use flexible silicone at corners and changes of plane. Preparing each joint for the right material gives the repair a neat finish and allows movement where it is needed.','砖与砖之间更新填缝，转角与平面交接处使用柔性硅胶。我们按接缝位置处理基层、选用材料，让修复整洁，并在需要的位置保留活动余量。'],
 ['shower-regrouting-resealing-adelaide.html','We look at accessible tiles, grout and seals, and ask about dampness outside the shower, recurring cracks and previous repairs. Loose tiles, ongoing moisture or movement in the base can limit the value of simply renewing the surface joints. Staining alone does not establish the condition beneath the tiles.','We check tiles, grout and seals alongside recurring cracks or dampness outside the shower. If water is coming from beneath the tiled surface, we explain the connected leak repair or membrane work rather than repeating a surface reseal.','我们结合反复开裂、淋浴间外受潮等情况检查瓷砖、填缝与密封。若水来自瓷砖下方，会向您说明相关漏水修复或防水层施工，不反复只做表面封胶。'],
 ['bathroom-renovation-waterproofing-adelaide.html','Your written quote separates removal, preparation, waterproofing, tiling and materials, and identifies related trade inclusions and exclusions. A coordinated membrane and tile service does not assume a complete bathroom renovation package. The table summarises what we confirm for your project.','Your quote brings the project stages into one clear breakdown: removal, base preparation, waterproofing, tiles, materials and related trade arrangements. The table helps you see what is included and how each stage connects to the next.','报价把项目阶段清晰列出：拆除、基层、防水、贴砖、材料及相关工种安排。下表方便您查看包含项目，以及各阶段如何衔接。'],
 ['*','Illustrative tiling scene; not a completed Ellis project.','Floor tiling · installation illustration.','地面贴砖 · 安装示意。'],
 ['*','Our independent Adelaide team is based at 63 Pirie St, Adelaide SA 5000. Learn','Speak with our local team at 63 Pirie St, Adelaide SA 5000. Learn','欢迎联系位于 63 Pirie St, Adelaide SA 5000 的本地团队。了解']
